window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>My journey at Silvercrest Academy has become a perilous cycle I can't seem to break. And if the visions are true, then I am the key to bringing this madness to an end.</b></p> <p>The threats have never been more prevalent. Danger lurks around every corner as I seek strength from surprising allies and promised oaths. It's time I break these chains and embrace who I am, what I stand for, and what I am capable of.</p> <p>I'm not here to protect the academy, the Elevin Realm, or the Monarchy. I live, breathe, and fight for my Bishops. If that makes me selfish, then so be it.</p> <p>Because I'm no hero.</p> <p>I'm just me.</p> <p>Just Raven.</p> <p>Once a Void; Now, forever theirs.</p>"; 
